# Kody Sync Test Rule

@kody-sync

This rule carries the `@kody-sync` marker on purpose. It validates that
rules marked this way keep syncing even when the repository's IDE
auto-sync toggle (`ideRulesSyncEnabled`) is turned off — i.e. they get
`pinnedSync = true` and are excluded from the "orphan auto-sync" chip.

## Rule

- Exported functions must declare an explicit return type.
